# Example requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Start first: make up (fresh data: 100 customers c001..c100 with 5,000.00; 20 products p001..p020 with 100 units)
@orders = http://localhost:8081
@payments = http://localhost:8082
@inventory = http://localhost:8084

### Place an order (202). Repeat with the same Idempotency-Key → 200 with the same order
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-42

{"customerId": "c001", "productId": "p001", "quantity": 2, "amount": "149.90"}

### Follow the saga: PAYMENT_PENDING → STOCK_PENDING → COMPLETED (replace the id)
GET {{orders}}/orders/REPLACE-WITH-ORDER-ID

### Balance and stock after it
GET {{payments}}/accounts/c001

###
GET {{inventory}}/products/p001

### Declined: more than the customer has
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-43

{"customerId": "c002", "productId": "p002", "quantity": 1, "amount": "6000.00"}

### Payment record of an order (CHARGED / DECLINED / REFUNDED)
GET {{payments}}/payments/REPLACE-WITH-ORDER-ID

### Replay dead-lettered commands (admin)
POST {{payments}}/admin/dlt/replay?topic=payments.commands&max=100
X-Admin-Token: dev-admin-token

### Health and metrics
GET {{orders}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{orders}}/actuator/prometheus
